cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this version of powerfit using the v2.0.0 DOI below. For the numerical
  evidence used by the manuscript, cite the v1.0.0 frozen archive and
  pyvoro2 0.6.3 separately. Cite the associated article when its own
  publication identifier is available.
title: >-
  powerfit: reproducibility materials for inverse fitting of
  power-diagram weights from pairwise separator data
type: software
version: 2.0.0
authors:
