  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24047266
    description: Reserved version DOI for the powerfit v2.0.0 release.
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Version 2.0.0 provides the revised manuscript source, figure and build
  helpers, and frozen experimental protocols, inputs, and results for inverse
  fitting of power-diagram weights from pairwise separator data. Experimental
  evidence remains preserved in powerfit v1.0.0. The MIT license applies to
  first-party materials; bundled third-party artifacts retain their upstream
  licenses and notices.
keywords:
  - power diagram
  - Laguerre tessellation
  - inverse problem
  - graph Laplacian
  - reproducibility
